    "culturalContext": {
      "references": [],
      "rationale": "Design rationale for The Cyberbotanist:\nColor approach: warm palette reflecting interconnectedness.\nTypography: handcrafted style for discoverability.\nDensity: rich to match their Are.na habits.\nKey influences: Annihilation, ambient, greenhouses.\nA biologist who studies fungi networks by day, programs LED grow systems by night. They believe technology should feel organic and alive."
    },
